  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(88³ + 70³ − 106³) + 54³\n\n**Formula used:**\n\na³ = a × a × a\n\n**Calculations:**\n\n⇒ 88³ = 88 × 88 × 88 = 681472\n\n⇒ 70³ = 70 × 70 × 70 = 343000\n\n⇒ 106³ = 106 × 106 × 106 = 1191016\n\n⇒ 54³ = 54 × 54 × 54 = 157464\n\n⇒ 88³ + 70³ = 681472 + 343000 = 1024472\n\n⇒ 1024472 − 1191016 = −166544\n\n⇒ −166544 + 157464 = −9080\n\n**∴ The final result is −9080.**",
